---
import Navbar from './Navbar.astro';
---

<section class="slide about-slide" id="about">
	<header class="about-header">
		<Navbar theme="dark" active="about" showLogo />
	</header>

	<div class="about-content-wrapper">
		<div class="about-center">
			<img src="/about/image.png" alt="Mauricio Atencia" class="about-image" />
		</div>

		<div class="about-footer-container">
			<div class="location-text">Medellín, Colombia</div>
			<hr class="about-divider" />
			<div class="about-footer-content">
				<div class="about-title">About</div>
				<h1 class="name-title">Mauricio Atencia</h1>
				<div class="about-text">
					<p>
						la ficha studio es el proyecto con el cual durante más de cuatro años he desarrollado identidades visuales, experiencias de marca y espacios comerciales donde la estrategia, el diseño y la ejecución, trabajan como un solo sistema.
					</p>
					<p>
						Mi enfoque combina branding, retail y dirección de arte para crear marcas coherentes, memorables y listas para el mundo real.
					</p>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>

<style>
	.about-slide {
		flex: 0 0 100vw;
		width: 100vw;
		height: 100vh;
		scroll-snap-align: start;
		position: relative;
		overflow: hidden;
		box-sizing: border-box;

		background-color: #eeedec;
		color: #000000;
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		justify-content: space-between;
	}

	.about-header {
		position: relative;
		z-index: 2;
		padding: 1.5rem 3rem 0 2rem;
		display: flex;
		align-items: flex-start;
		width: 100%;
		box-sizing: border-box;
		justify-content: flex-end;
	}

	.about-content-wrapper {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		flex: 1;
		min-height: 0;
		padding: 0 clamp(3rem, 3.35vw, 5.25rem) clamp(3rem, 3.35vw, 5.25rem) clamp(2rem, 2.25vw, 3.5rem);
		box-sizing: border-box;
		width: 100%;
	}

	.about-center {
		flex: 1;
		min-height: 0;
		display: flex;
		justify-content: center;
		align-items: flex-end;
		padding: 0 0 clamp(0.85rem, 1.2vw, 1.5rem) 0;
	}

	.about-image {
		height: clamp(180px, 32vh, 480px);
		max-height: 100%;
		min-width: 180px;
		width: auto;
		object-fit: cover;
		transform: translateY(clamp(1.25rem, 1.8vw, 2.25rem));
	}

	@media (max-width: 1440px) {
		.about-center {
			padding-bottom: 0.5rem;
		}

		.about-image {
			height: clamp(80px, 18vw, 280px);
			min-width: 0;
			transform: translateY(clamp(1.25rem, 1.8vw, 2.25rem));
		}
	}

	@media (max-width: 1024px) {
		.about-image {
			height: clamp(60px, 14vw, 180px);
			min-width: 0;
			transform: translateY(1.25rem);
		}
	}

	@media (max-width: 600px) {
		.about-image {
			height: clamp(50px, 18vw, 110px);
			min-width: 0;
			transform: translateY(0.85rem);
		}
	}

	.about-footer-container {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		width: 100%;
	}

	.location-text {
		font-family: var(--font-helvetica);
		font-weight: 300;
		font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.05vw, 1.6rem);
		text-align: right;
		margin-bottom: clamp(0.5rem, 0.6vw, 1rem);
		letter-spacing: 0.03em;
	}

	.about-divider {
		border: none;
		border-top: clamp(2px, 0.15vw, 4px) solid #000000;
		width: 100%;
		margin: 0 0 clamp(1rem, 1.1vw, 1.75rem) 0;
	}

	.about-footer-content {
		display: flex;
		justify-content: flex-start;
		align-items: flex-start;
		gap: 0;
	}

	.about-title {
		font-family: var(--font-nav);
		font-weight: 600;
		font-size: clamp(1.25rem, 1.4vw, 2.15rem);
		flex: 0 0 auto;
		line-height: 1;
		padding-top: 0.15em;
		margin-right: clamp(0.75rem, 1.2vw, 1.5rem);
	}

	.name-title {
		font-family: var(--font-nav);
		font-weight: 600;
		font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 3.4vw, 4.75rem);
		margin: 0;
		color: #000000;
		line-height: 0.95;
		flex: 0 1 auto;
		min-width: 0;
		letter-spacing: -0.022em;
		-webkit-text-stroke: max(1px, 0.06vw) #000000;
	}

	.about-text {
		font-family: var(--font-helvetica);
		font-weight: 300;
		font-size: clamp(0.95rem, 1.05vw, 1.55rem);
		line-height: 1.4;
		flex: 0 0 50rem;
		width: 50rem;
		max-width: 50rem;
		margin-left: clamp(7rem, 11vw, 15rem);
		text-align: justify;
	}

	.about-text p {
		margin: 0;
	}

	.about-text p + p {
		margin-top: 1em;
	}
</style>
